33503", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974905_2337683469766836_5984765557162439058_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2GNHhWWwPAYQ7kNvwEx4Qwv&_nc_oc=AdoUqzk1p08MbBRYk6AXAy1uhmULTrvCS_UKyK36ZYySURphAYAoULHWqMZ7b9qmmcw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQh26LNARA0qeJo2PU8SaLT7v4Ezr-qyddA7AhNT4bsnA&oe=6B01DBF5"}, "display_name": "Squirrel Day", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Squirrel Day is a VR platformer about climbing, exploring, and collecting. Use your paws to crawl, jump, and grab to travel around the tree branches and collect the nuts as fast as possible.\n\n-- Physics-based movement system. Move your hands to move your body. Push off of any surface to move in the opposite direction. \n\n-- Use the index triggers to grab any surface.\n\n-- Use the grip trigger to point and interact with your watch\n\n-- Use watch to change display refresh rate (72 or 90Hz) and adjust snap turn angle or enable smooth turning\n\n-- Use either thumbstick to rotate\n\n-- Arrow indicator on watch will point to nearest nut.\n\n-- Timer starts when first nut is collected.\n\nATTENTION! This is an early version. I'm still optimizing art and finishing up the level designs. Hope you enjoy it! Email granitetopgames@gmail dot com with any feedback or issues. Thanks!", "short_description": "Climb, collect, and explore from the eyes of a squirrel in this single-player platforming game. Let's get nuts!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.granitetopgames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Granite Top Games", "support_website_url": "http://www.granitetopgames.com/", "website_url": "http://www.granitetopgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "52814231646